1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,050
Everyone thinks only mammals make milk.

2
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:11,050
Wrong, cow. I make milk too. It's called crop milk.

3
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:18,170
Dad pigeons make it too. Both parents feed the babies.

4
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:23,050
Flamingos and penguins do it as well.

5
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:29,800
I'm doing more parenting than your whole street.
